// A quote in the plate status or plate name stays escaped.
// Rank, concept, line, and the store stay.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE escape ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law    ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG escape law

IMPULSE escape 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "escape" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
